            "key": "write-concept",
            "label": "Write or update the MV concept",
            "body": "{target}\n\nRead the `busa-mv` skill in this folder and follow its workflow, then write or update the project's treatment: a one-line summary of what the MV is and its tonality, a one-line visual `look`, and the aspect ratio. Keep it to those three things — do not add song-section taxonomies or extra fields."
